@startuml
' 实验二：时序图（退票与自动递补）

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam BorderColor #7C8AA0
skinparam TitleFontSize 17
skinparam TitleFontColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FBF9F1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D8D2BE
skinparam NoteFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF2F7
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #7C8AA0
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #A8B4C4
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FAFBFD
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #A8B4C4
skinparam sequenceActivationBackgroundColor #DCE5F0
skinparam sequenceActivationBorderColor #7C8AA0

title 活动票务与报名系统 · 时序图（退票与自动递补）

participant "参与者" as Buyer
participant "我的订单界面" as UI
participant "候补退款服务" as RefundSvc
participant "订单" as Order
participant "票档" as Tier
participant "候补记录" as Wait
participant "站内通知" as Notify
participant "审计日志" as Audit

Buyer -> UI : 点击「申请退票」
activate UI
UI -> RefundSvc : 退票(订单号)
activate RefundSvc

RefundSvc -> Order : 查询状态与开演时间
activate Order
Order --> RefundSvc : 已出票，距开演 5 天
deactivate Order

RefundSvc -> RefundSvc : 按阶梯规则计算手续费（40%）

alt 距开演超过 3 天，允许退票
  RefundSvc -> Order : 转为已取消
  RefundSvc -> Tier : 释放 1 个名额
  RefundSvc -> RefundSvc : 生成退款（实付 − 手续费）
  RefundSvc -> Notify : 通知退票结果

  RefundSvc -> Wait : 取队首候补记录
  activate Wait
  loop 队列非空且该票档有余票
    Wait --> RefundSvc : 候补记录
    RefundSvc -> Order : 创建订单并转为已出票
    RefundSvc -> Notify : 推送递补成功通知
    RefundSvc -> Wait : 取下一位
  end
  deactivate Wait

else 不足 3 天或已开演
  RefundSvc --> UI : 拒绝退票并提示原因
end

RefundSvc -> Audit : 写入退票与递补审计日志
deactivate RefundSvc

UI --> Buyer : 显示退票结果
deactivate UI

@enduml
